{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S11、S12等短停留段的感受提示偏密，容易让观众来不及消化；Y的左右分栏在区分叙事与伴随感受方面更直观。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的【】能让没读过原文的观众迅速抓住人物每一阶段的核心处境和心理转折，小字感受又通过出现时机与音乐建立联系，不必一次性处理一大堆情绪词。尤其是从怀念、挣扎、孤独、重新审视到带着想念继续生活的过程，X不仅交代了人物为什么这样想，也用具体的音乐变化和身体感受把前后串起来。Y的分栏更容易区分信息类型，但大量感受词同时出现，容易变成情绪标签的集合，细节之间的先后、轻重和变化不如X清楚。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "37dfeccf-b308-4b14-a55b-a8778f35cef8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T012118932545Z", "elapsed_seconds": 56.969, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:22:15.923146+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f250c07cd02d6dbda206f1a58672b98b03653e3502832a28692ec62659613fe0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\